    "sky_burn_engine": "SKY burned by the Smart Burn Engine \u2014 the 10/55 share of a month's buys, retired by the following month's spell. This is the buyback-policy number",
    "sky_burn_supply_correction": "SKY burned by the protocol before the TMF took effect. Exactly one event: the 2025-06-30 spell retiring 426,292,860.23 SKY of supply created in the MKR -> SKY conversion. A closed category \u2014 the boundary is a fixed past timestamp",
    "sky_burn_protocol": "sky_burn_engine + sky_burn_supply_correction. Predates the split and is dominated by the correction; prefer sky_burn_engine for anything about buyback policy",
