  "notes": [
    "The Splitter was deployed 2024-09-17 (block 20,770,191); the first kick ran 2024-11-14. The USDS farm leg pointed at the LSMKR USDS farm (0x9228\u20267cb1) from 2024-10-21 to 2025-05-19 and at the LSSKY USDS farm (0x38e4\u20268865) since; 'usds_to_stakers' covers both (the per-kick CSV carries the farm address).",
    "Kicks under splitter.burn = 100% have usds_to_stakers = 0 by construction (Feb\u2013May 2025, Nov 2025 \u2013 Aug 17 2026).",
    "SKY burns carry a `kind`, and every period row splits them, because the two protocol kinds are indistinguishable on-chain (both are Pause Proxy -> zero address). `engine`: the Smart Burn Engine's own burn \u2014 10/55 of the SKY bought under the 55% regime, i.e. from the kicks at or after source.tmf_effective_from, retired by the following month's spell; the first one cast 2026-09-13 and burned 2,860,943.76 SKY. `supply_correction`: the 2025-06-30 executive retiring 426,292,860.23 SKY of supply created in the MKR->SKY conversion \u2014 a closed category, since the boundary is a fixed past timestamp. `third_party`: anyone else sending SKY to 0x\u2026dEaD.",
    "Aggregates are quantized to 2 dp (price to 6 dp) for charting; the CSVs are exact. A period with burns but no kicks has null sky_avg_price / first_ts / last_ts."
